extends _layout.pug

block vars
  - var root = "./"
  - var title = "Leo Auri – sound/music"
  - var bodyClass = "page-introduction"
  - var current = "home"

block siteHeader
  header
    hgroup
      h1 Leo Auri
      h2 sound/music

block content
  p
    | I create music and sound for fictional realities (
    a(href='#works') theater, video, …
    | ).
  p
    | I write music for myself and others. I play and sing in 
    a(href='tag/bands/') bands
    | . I play piano in jazz and improvised music contexts.
  p
    | I released a lot of music you can 
    a(href='category/albums/') listen
    |  to.
  p
    | Additionally I am involved in 
    a(href='research/') research into sound generation with artificial neural networks
    | .
  p
    | All in all I do 
    a(href='recent/') a ton of things
    |  involving composition, production, and technology.
  p
    | I maintain 
    a(href='press-materials/') press texts and photos
    | , and 
    a(href='acknowledgements-licenses/') acknowledgements, licenses
    | , and 
    a(href='imprint-privacy/') privacy statements
    |  for this site.
  p
    | Reach me via 
    a(href='mailto:claypigeon@leoauri.com') email
    | , 
    a(href='https://soundcloud.com/leo-auri' rel='noopener' target='_blank') soundcloud
    | , or 
    a(href='https://github.com/leoauri' rel='noopener' target='_blank') github
    | .
  section#theatre
    h2 Theatre
    .shorts
